# hy4-flash-dfly-i8.recipe -- Hy4-flash's DFly2 drafter (the `dfly.*` tensors) at eight bits: every draft
# linear but kv_a and kv_b as int8 codes rotated by the 128-wide Hadamard with a bf16 scale a (row,
# 128 of K) (`i8*bf16[1x128]/fwht128`), the form the trunk's int8 linears are read in
# (hy4-flash-i8.recipe). Meant to be appended to a trunk recipe, or used alone (a bf16 trunk with an
# int8 drafter: the drafter's linears were 11% of a decode step in bf16, docs/HY4FLASH-QUANT.md).
#
#   rad-convert <Hy4-flash checkpoint> --add engram-tables.safetensors \
#       --recipe data/recipes/hy4-flash-dfly-i8.recipe -o hy4-flash-dfly-i8.rad
#
# The plugin reads whatever form of the trunk's set (plain or rotated int8, IQ8R, the rotated u4/u5 and
# trellis forms) a draft linear is stored in; this recipe is one choice, not a requirement. Not kv_a:
# its 576 rows are no whole 128-row tile of libr4d's int8 prefill tile, so a draft pass of more than 64
# rows (more than 10 sequences at depth 5) would fall to the host; kv_b is read by mla_project_kv, which
# reads bf16 only (the plugin declines a quantised one); the token embedding, the norms, the
# confidence head and the fusion gate stay as shipped. At TP every K a rank reads is a whole number
# of 128 blocks at the real sizes (attention output 8192 by heads, MLP down 9216 by columns: 4608 at TP2,
# 36 blocks; at TP4 2304, 18 blocks).
#
# PATTERN                              QUANTISER  OPTIONS
dfly.blk.*.attn_q_a.weight             rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
dfly.blk.*.attn_q_b.weight             rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
dfly.blk.*.attn_gate.weight            rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
dfly.blk.*.attn_output.weight          rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
dfly.blk.*.ffn_gate_up.weight          rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
dfly.blk.*.ffn_down.weight             rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
dfly.fusion.weight                     rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
dfly.correct_gate.weight               rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
dfly.correct_up.weight                 rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
dfly.correct_down.weight               rtn        codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
